OL,3,GNEWSAIvan Toney nightclub assault trial
OL,4,Aset for 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland striker Ivan Toney will face
OL,7,Ftrial in 2028 over the alleged assault
OL,8,Fof a man at a central London nightclub.
OL,10,FThe 30-year-old footballer, from
OL,11,FNorthampton, previously pleaded not
OL,12,Fguilty to attacking Saber Da Silva at a
OL,13,Fnightclub in Wardour Street, Soho, on 6
OL,14,FDecember 2025.
OL,16,FHe formally entered this plea at
OL,17,FSouthwark Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,18,Fwhere a provisional trial date was set
OL,19,Ffor the same court of 12 June 2028.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
