OL,3,GNEWSAIvan Toney nightclub assault trial
OL,4,Aset for 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Christopher Hehir told the
OL,7,Fdefendant he was "sorry" about the
OL,8,Fdelay, adding: "As you may know, the
OL,9,Fcrown courts are operating under a
OL,10,Fgreat deal of pressure. We have got a
OL,11,Fmassive backlog of work for various
OL,12,Freasons."
